        "dialogs": {
          "$type": "System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp]], mscorlib",
          "$values": [
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "艾莎莎尼",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_27017_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "嘿飒！预留的停车位，正正好好。\n现在，让我隆重向你介绍，\n热闹非凡的——<style=Highlight>星空街市</style>！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_27017_content",
                "value": "嘿飒！预留的停车位，正正好好。\n现在，让我隆重向你介绍，\n热闹非凡的——<style=Highlight>星空街市</style>！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 27017
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "艾莎莎尼",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_27018_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "音乐舞台的竞赛，好逛到尖叫的市集，\n最近还有魔术～抽奖！\n<style=SizeSmall>到底什么时候能中一次大奖……</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_27018_content",
                "value": "音乐舞台的竞赛，好逛到尖叫的市集，\n最近还有魔术～抽奖！\n<style=SizeSmall>到底什么时候能中一次大奖……</style>",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 27018
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "艾莎莎尼",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_33556_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "对了对了，在星空街市遇到新朋友时，\n{A打招呼}还可以和对方<style=Highlight>打招呼</style>，就像这样！\n那现在，出发……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_33556_content",
                "value": "对了对了，在星空街市遇到新朋友时，\n{A打招呼}还可以和对方<style=Highlight>打招呼</style>，就像这样！\n那现在，出发……",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 33556
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_3956756896_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "等、等出发——你们、跑、真快……\n我刚转身去桌上拿个东西，\n转眼你们人不见了嚯！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_3956756896_content",
                "value": "等、等出发——你们、跑、真快……\n我刚转身去桌上拿个东西，\n转眼你们人不见了嚯！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3956756896
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_3956756897_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "前往星空街市，\n是我们星球连接全星海所有星球的第一步，\n首先，我们需要登记成为一个正式的站点。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_3956756897_content",
                "value": "前往星空街市，\n是我们星球连接全星海所有星球的第一步，\n首先，我们需要登记成为一个正式的站点。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3956756897
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "艾莎莎尼",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_3956756898_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "忘了这件事了~嘿飒？\n<style=SizeSmall>嚯？感觉莫白在看我……</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_3956756898_content",
                "value": "忘了这件事了~嘿飒？\n<style=SizeSmall>嚯？感觉莫白在看我……</style>",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3956756898
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_3956756899_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "请<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>作为种星人，\n代表<style=PlayerName>{homestar}</style>星，\n前往星空街市，办理站点连接的相关手续。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_600301_3956756899_content",
                "value": "请<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>作为种星人，\n代表<style=PlayerName>{homestar}</style>星，\n前往星空街市，办理站点连接的相关手续。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
